+# Activities
+
+Activities represent events that happen across boards in an account, such as cards being added, moved, assigned, renamed, closed, or commented on.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities.json`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity events you have access to, sorted newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific metadata:
+
+- `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`: `{ "assignee_ids": ["..."] }`
+- `card_board_changed`: `{ "old_board": "...", "new_board": "..." }`
+- `card_title_changed`: `{ "old_title": "...", "new_title": "..." }`
+- `card_triaged`: `{ "column": "..." }`
+- Other events: `{}`
+
+__Response:__
+
